   1:Source/html/tokenizer.c **** /*
   2:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — tokenizer.c
   3:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  * Single-pass HTML tokenizer (port of Source/html/tokenizer.lua).
   4:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *
   5:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  * Every branch of the Lua reference is reproduced, including quirks that are
   6:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  * part of observable behavior (verified against the actual reference):
   7:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *   - attribute value search starts at ke+1 (right after the key): with a
   8:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *     spaced '=' ("z = \"b\"") the search lands ON '=', which is excluded
   9:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *     from the unquoted-value charset, so the value is "" and the rest of
  10:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *     the attribute string re-scans from there (tc8 parity: z=[] b=true).
  11:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *   - '</b>' closing tags report isSelfClosing=1 (Lua: isSelfClosing = slash
  12:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *     or isClosing); '<br>' reports isSelfClosing=0.
  13:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *   - boolean attributes store the TRUE sentinel; duplicate attrs first-win.
  14:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *   - the 256KB cut searches '>' from 1-based max(1, cut-128) — i.e. 0-based
  15:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *     MAX-129 — and keeps everything through that '>'.
  16:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *   - an unterminated <title> consumes only the opening tag (no token) when
  17:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *     no '</title>' exists; a found one skips titleClose+8 and may leave
  18:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *     '</title>'-interior bytes for the next loop iteration (Lua parity).
  19:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  *
  20:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  * Strings produced during tokenizing are copied into an internal arena
  21:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  * (grow-only, freed with the result) so 256KB pages don't fragment the small
ARM GAS  /var/folders/65/xyhbx3_n6nd_hs7j3p9nfwv80000gn/T//ccKIrz6f.s 			page 3


  22:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  * device heap with thousands of tiny allocations.
  23:Source/html/tokenizer.c ****  */
